    "summary": "A weaving-sample; a length of purple shot synthetic (?) silk with patterning worked in discontinuous supplementary weft using silver-coloured metal strip.  Black warp; pink/purple weft; tabby woven.  Cloth for a tube skirt, a &#039;phasin&#039;?; patterning worn as bands.  A 28 cms deep tree-of-life (?) band at one selvedge, triangular in outline, with isolated stylized floral motifs, worked on the diagonal, in the centre field.  Chemically dyed yarns; poor quality materials.  Warp ends raw.  Industrially woven.  Unused.",
